{"type":"text","timestamp":1794559830631,"sessionID":"ses_e2bec80c4ffeN1o4EKBC2zmu64","part":{"id":"prt_1d419d4cf002yL4lt1jt7x7hlS","sessionID":"ses_e2bec80c4ffeN1o4EKBC2zmu64","messageID":"msg_1d419b82d001DgroxXIM1i7yg5","type":"text","text":"T023 implemented and verified. The started-command labels now come from the runner's `G2_ROWS` table instead of a regex over the row id.\n\n**Files written**\n1. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs`: added `command` and `variant` to each of the six `G2_ROWS` entries.\n2. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs`: imports `G2_ROWS`, exports `startedLabel(rowId, rows = G2_ROWS)` which finds the row by id and builds the label from its `command` and `variant`, and deleted `STARTED_ROW` with its regex comment.\n3. `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts`: added the three named cases.\n\n**Before the change** (`npx vitest run tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts`): `Tests 3 failed | 2 passed (5)`, all three new cases failing with `TypeError: startedLabel is not a function`, which is the unexported state the task names.\n\n**Verify after the change**\n```\n$ cd .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime && env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-behaviour-guards.vitest.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  5 passed (5)\n```\n```\n$ cd .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime && env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/command-transcript-score.vitest.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  58 passed (58)\n```\n```\n$ node .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs --summary specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-g2.jsonl --json | jq -cS 'map_values(.g2.startRate)'\n{\"claude\":\"3 of 6\",\"codex\":\"0 of 6\",\"devin\":\"4 of 6\",\"dsh\":\"3 of 4\",\"opencode\":\"5 of 6\",\"pi\":\"4 of 6\"}\n```\nBoth `node --check` runs exited 0. `git status --short` names only the two modified `.mjs` files and the new test file. No scratch output was created, and the checkbox in `tasks.md` is unticked as instructed. Nothing in the task could not be done.","time":{"start":1794559825103,"end":1794559830631}}}
